  nonce: 5d19  # 5d19
  message: "PR #2230 merged (dev 5a38b95bb): the publish step now FAILS FAST AND SAYS WHY. ssh runs with BatchMode=yes and ConnectTimeout=20, so the runner's unreachable port 22 will read 'ssh: connect to host github.com port 22: Connection timed out' after 20 s; a git command that still outlasts 120 s names what it was doing and the remote. Tests: tests/test_publish_scheduled_verdict.py (a stand-in ssh that never answers; four mutations red). THIS DOES NOT PUBLISH ANYTHING: the transport is unchanged and the item still waits on the owner's choice among the three ways recorded above. Expect the 01:00 UTC run of 2026-11-18 to end red at publish-verdict with that ssh line; if it says anything else, the diagnosis is incomplete."  # 5d19
